    "answer": "1当n_1=1时,n=2n_0,h=[log2(n+1)]=[log2(2n_0+1)]。\n2当 n_1=0时,n=2n_0-1,h=[log2(n+1)]=[log2(2n_0)=[log2(n_0)]+ 1",
